/**
 * @file[zh-cn] JsonMacros JSON 注解宏重公开
 * @brief[zh-cn] 重公开 cjfast_json 注解宏的宏包（three.resource.serializer.macros）
 * @explain[zh-cn] 仓颉规则：非宏包不能重导出宏包符号（public import fastjson.macros.* 在普通包内报错），而宏包中可以重导出宏包与非宏包的符号。故本宏包子包负责：重导出 fastjson.macros 的注解宏（@JsonAdapter / @JsonName / @JsonIgnore / @JsonIgnoreNull），同时重导出 fastjson / fastjson.stream 的运行时类型。@JsonAdapter 宏展开生成的 fromJson/toJson 代码会引用这些符号，用户只需 import 本宏包即可正确编译。
 *
 * @file[en] JsonMacros  JSON annotation macro re-export
 * @brief[en] Re-exports cjfast_json annotation macros package (three.resource.serializer.macros)
 * @explain[en] Cangjie rule: non-macro packages cannot re-export macro package symbols (public import fastjson.macros.* in a regular package causes an error), while macro packages can re-export both macro and non-macro symbols. This macro sub-package is responsible for: re-exporting fastjson.macros annotation macros (@JsonAdapter / @JsonName / @JsonIgnore / @JsonIgnoreNull), and re-exporting fastjson / fastjson.stream runtime types. The fromJson/toJson code generated by @JsonAdapter macro expansion references these symbols; users only need to import this macro package for correct compilation.
 */
macro package three.resource.serializer.macros

// 重导出注解宏（宏包允许重导出宏包符号）
public import fastjson.macros.*

public import fastjson.*
public import fastjson.stream.*